  "description": "Know about errors before your users do. Instant Telegram alerts on your phone with emoji-coded severity — because email is too slow for production fires. Fire-and-forget delivery: Emit() never blocks the Serilog pipeline. ConcurrentDictionary throttle prevents duplicate messages under burst load. Zero Telegram SDK dependencies — uses BCL HttpClient with configurable timeout.",
